 JR &amp; Green R Stop codon context influences genome-wide stimulation of termination codon readthrough by aminoglycosides. Elife 9, (2020).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC7089771</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">31971508</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Dong C. et al. Intron retention-induced neoantigen load correlates with unfavorable prognosis in multiple myeloma. Oncogene 40, 6130&#8211;6138, (2021).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC8426332</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">34504297</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Lin HC et al. C-Terminal End-Directed Protein Elimination by CRL2 Ubiquitin Ligases. Mol Cell 70, 602&#8211;613 e603, (2018).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC6145449</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">29775578</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Koren I. et al. The Eukaryotic Proteome Is Shaped by E3 Ubiquitin Ligases Targeting C-Terminal Degrons. Cell 173, 1622&#8211;1635 e1614, (2018).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC6003881</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">29779948</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Dyson HJ &amp; Wright PE Intrinsically unstructured proteins and their functions. Nat Rev Mol Cell Biol 6, 197&#8211;208, (2005).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">15738986</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhang YE, Vibranovski MD, Landback P, Marais GAB &amp; Long MY Chromosomal Redistribution of Male-Biased Genes in Mammalian Evolution with Two Bursts of Gene Gain on the X Chromosome. Plos Biology 8, (2010).</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2950125</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">20957185</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Wolfenden RV, Cullis PM &amp; Southgate CC Water, protein folding, and the genetic code. Science 206, 575&#8211;577, (1979).</Citation><Arti